{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-jhn-16-1","title":"John 16:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Christ comforts his disciples by the promise of the Holy Ghost, and his ascension; 23 assures their prayers made in his name to be acceptable. 33 Peace in Christ, and in the world affliction.</p>\n<p>4; 15:11; Mt 11:6; 13:21,57; 24:10; 26:31-33; Ro 14:21; Php 1:10 1Pe 2:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-16-2","title":"John 16:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>shall. 9:22,34; 12:42; Lu 6:22; 1Co 4:13 the time. Isa 65:5; Mt 10:28; 24:9; Ac 5:33; 6:13,14; 7:56-60; 8:1-3; 9:1,2 Ac 22:3,4,19-23; 26:9-11; Ro 10:2,3; Ga 1:13,14; Php 3:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-16-3","title":"John 16:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>because. 8:19,55; 15:21,23; 17:3,25; Lu 10:22; 1Co 2:8; 2Co 4:3-6; 2Th 1:8 2Th 2:10-12; 1Ti 1:13; 1Jo 3:1; 4:8; 5:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-16-4","title":"John 16:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>that when. 13:19; 14:29; Isa 41:22,23; Mt 10:7; 24:25; Mr 13:23; Lu 21:12,13 Ac 9:16; 20:23,24; 2Pe 1:14 because. 17:12,13; Mt 9:15; Mr 2:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-16-5","title":"John 16:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>I. 10,16,28; 6:62; 7:33; 13:3; 14:28; 17:4,13; Eph 4:7-11; Heb 1:3; 12:2 Whither. 13:36; 14:4-6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-16-6","title":"John 16:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>20-22; 14:1,27,28; 20:11-15; Lu 22:45; 24:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-16-7","title":"John 16:7","