":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>Jesus. 30; 2:24,25; 21:17; Ps 139:1-4; Mt 6:8; 9:4; Mr 9:33,34; Heb 4:13 Re 2:23 A little. 16; 7:33; 13:33; 14:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-16-20","title":"John 16:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>That. 6,33; 19:25-27; Mr 14:72; 16:10; Lu 22:45,62; 23:47-49; 24:17,21 but the. Job 20:5; Mt 21:38; 27:39-44,62-66; Mr 15:29-32; Re 11:10; 18:7 your. Ps 30:5,11; 40:1-3; 97:11; 126:5,6; Isa 12:1; 25:8,9; 61:3; 66:5 Jer 31:9-14,25; Mt 5:4; Lu 6:21; Ac 2:46,47; 5:41; Ro 5:2,3,11 2Co 6:10; Ga 5:22; 1Th 1:6; 2Th 2:16,17; Jas 1:2; 1Pe 1:6-8 Jude 1:24; Re 7:14-17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-16-21","title":"John 16:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>woman. Ge 3:16; Isa 26:16-18; Jer 30:6,7; Ho 13:13,14; Mic 4:10; Re 12:2-5 for. Ge 21:6,7; 30:23,24; 1Sa 1:26,27; Ps 113:9; Lu 1:57,58; Ga 4:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-16-22","title":"John 16:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>ye now. 6,20 But. 14:1,27; 20:19,20; 21:7; Isa 25:9; 65:13,14; 66:9-14; Mt 28:8 Lu 24:41,51-53; Ac 2:46; 13:52; 1Pe 1:8 and your. 4:14; Job 34:29; Ps 146:2; Isa 12:2-4; 51:11,12; 54:7,8; 65:18,19 Hab 3:17,18; Lu 10:42; 16:25; 19:26; Ac 5:41; 16:25; 20:23,24 Ro 8:35-39; 1Th 3:7-9; 2Th 2:16; Heb 6:18; 10:34; 1Pe 1:8; 4:13,14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-16-23","title":"John 16:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>ask. 19; 13:36,37; 14:5,22; 15:15; 21:20,21 Whatsoever. 14:13,14; 15:7,16; Isa 65:24; Mt 7:7; 21:22; Eph 2:18; 3:14-20 1Ti 2:5,6; Heb 4:14-16; 7:25,26; 10:19-23; 1Jo 2:1; 5:14-16